{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "偏导数的几何意义与截面切线",
    "goals": [
      "理解固定y=y₀截面在三维曲面上截出的二维曲线",
      "理解对x的偏导数等于固定截线上一元函数的导数",
      "明确截面位置y₀与切线斜率的区别与计算步骤",
      "掌握在给定点求对x偏导数并建立截线与切线几何图景的方法"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "通过三维曲面截面动画建立固定变量的直观几何图景",
        "辨析截面平移与截线上求导的区别，消除常见误区",
        "结合二维切线与三维截面建立代数推导与几何斜率的对应"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "截面位置 y₀",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.01
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-02-task-01",
        "prompt": "请试着将截面位置 y₀ 调整至 2，观察截线方程的变化。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "拖动 y₀ 滑块至 2",
          "当 y₀=2 时，截线方程变为 z = x² + 4"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "很好！你成功将截面移动到了 y₀ = 2 位置。",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 2,
          "tolerance": 0.005
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "建立固定y=y₀截面截出三维曲面的直观，明确偏导数的几何前提",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "欢迎来到第二课。上一课我们观察了曲面整体，现在我们要研究同一高度上的点。求对 x 的偏导数时，关键在于固定输入 y 为常数 y₀。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "scene3d",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "曲面 z = x² + y² 与截面 y = y₀",
                "fallback": "函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。",
                "axes": true,
                "camera": {
                  "yaw": 0.72,
                  "pitch": 0.55,
                  "zoom": 1
                },
                "objects": [
                  {
                    "as": "surface",
                    "kind": "surface",
                    "label": "z=x^2 + y^2",
                    "color": "teal",
                    "expression": "x^2 + y^2",
                    "x_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "y_range": {
                      "min": -2,
                      "max": 2
                    },
                    "samples": 12
                  }
                ],
                "sections": [
                  {
                    "as": "section",
                    "axis": "y",
                    "value": 0,
                    "targets": [
                      "surface"
                    ],
                    "display": "plane_and_intersection",
                    "label": "截面",
                    "color": "orange"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "section.value",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "偏导数∂f/∂x的几何研究步骤",
                "items": [
                  "1. 固定输入 y = y₀，引入垂直截面",
                  "2. 观察截面截出的曲线 z = g(x)",
                  "3. 沿截线在指定点求一元函数导数"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "大家看，当固定 y 时，垂直截面 y = y₀ 切过旋转抛物面 z = x² + y²。在截面内部，允许 x 发生变化，z 随之改变，而 y 始终保持常数 y₀ 不变。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察截面与三维曲面相交形成的截线",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "辨析平移截面与求导的区别，并在特定截面上建立二维函数与切线",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "我们在上一课研究了固定高度 z 的情况。而要求对 x 的偏导数，核心是在输入端固定 y 为某个常数 y₀。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "引导学习者关注截面位置y₀对三维曲面截线的影响",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "以曲面 z 等于 x 平方加 y 平方为例，当 y 被固定在 y₀ 时，截面垂直于 y 轴。在此截面上，y 保持不变，只有 x 可以自由变化，从而决定高度 z 的变化。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z = f(x, y_0) = x^2 + y_0^2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)} = \\left.\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}(x^2+1^2)\\right|_{x=1} = 2"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "我现在把 y₀ 从 0 平移到 1。请注意，移动截面只是选择不同的研究曲线，平移本身并不是求导。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "当固定 y 等于 1 时，截线对应一元函数 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若取 x₀ 等于 1，则对应空间点 P 为 (1, 1, 2)。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "g(x) = x^2 + 1 \\implies g'(1) = 2 \\quad \\text{点 } P(1,1,2)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "我们在二维平面上观察这条截线，此时纵轴表示高度 z。截线为 z 等于 x 平方加 1，在 x 等于 1 处的切线方程为 z 等于 2x，其斜率 2 正是对 x 的偏导数。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-05-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "supporting_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "截面 y=1 内的截线与切线（纵轴为高度 z）",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -15,
                    "max": 20,
                    "label": "z"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                    "label": "截线 z=x²+1"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "curve-02",
                    "expression": "(2)*(x)",
                    "label": "P处切线 z=2x"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "right_of",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-04-item-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-05-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "建立二维截线与切线的相切几何图景",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-02-moment-05-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-03",
      "purpose": "严格推导偏导数数值与点斜式切线方程，总结一般方法与边界特征",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "承接之前的讨论，研究同一高度z是绘制二维等高线，而求对x的偏导数则是固定输入变量y等于y₀。在垂直截面内，y全程保持不变，允许x自由变化，高度z随之改变。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-05-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "明确固定y与截面截线的几何对应关系",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "对于截线函数，导数g′(x)=2x，在x=1处导数值为2。结合切点(1,2)，利用点斜式得到切线方程z-2=2(x-1)，即z=2x。这里的斜率是高度增量与x增量之比，而非屏幕上的角度。对于本例，偏导数f_x(x₀,y₀)=2x₀不依赖y₀，这是二次旋转抛物面的特殊性质；若换为f(x,y)=xy，其对x的偏导数就直接等于y。",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z - 2 = 2(x - 1) \\implies z = 2x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-05-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-03-moment-02-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\left. \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x} f(x, y_0) \\right|_{x = x_0}"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-04",
      "purpose": "总结偏导数核心概念，并通过思考题进行理解性自测与下一课铺垫",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "大家前面学习了截面与切线的关系。总结一下，当我们求对x的偏导数时，关键是将输入y固定为常数y0。此时沿着垂直于y轴的截面，曲面上只剩下x变化引起z变化的一元曲线。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "偏导数几何意义总结",
                "items": [
                  "求∂z/∂x时：固定输入y = y₀（截面垂直于y轴）",
                  "截线实质：三维曲面在截面上的二维一元函数 z = f(x, y₀)",
                  "偏导数值：截线上点P处的切线斜率"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-03-moment-02-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "偏导数核心概念总结与课后思考",
                "items": [
                  "1. ∂z/∂x 对应固定 y = y₀ 截面",
                  "2. ∂z/∂y 对应固定 x = x₀ 截面",
                  "3. 课后自测：验证当 x = 1, z = 2 时，y₀ = 1 的正确性",
                  "4. 下节预告：比较不同截面方向的导数与驻点判断"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-04-moment-01-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "强调固定y=y0是求对x偏导数的基本几何前提",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "请思考这个理解检查题：在点P(1,1,2)处，如果改为求对y的偏导数，我们应该固定哪个变量？同理，若保持x=1固定，希望对应截线上的点高度z为2，y0应该设为多少呢？",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-04-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "z = x^2 + y^2 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad 1^2 + y_0^2 = 2 \\quad (y_0 \\ge 0)"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-04-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "本课程深入讲解了偏导数的几何意义：通过固定一个变量（如y=y₀）得到截面曲线，将多元函数转化为截面上的局部一元函数，其切线的斜率即为偏导数。在下一课中，我们将进一步比较不同方向的变化率，寻找驻点与最值。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
      "section-02-moment-05-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
